OL,3,ACourts, spies and MPs: How the
OL,4,AMicrosoft outage has been felt around
OL,5,Athe world
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrom city governments in the US to
OL,8,FAustralian spy agencies, the disruption
OL,9,Fhas been widespread. Here's what's been
OL,10,Fhappening around the world.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/17
