OL,3,ABessent blames Lutnick's Commerce
OL,4,ADepartment for failing to block
OL,5,AMegaspeed
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent has
OL,8,Fblamed the Commerce Department, run by
OL,9,FHoward Lutnick, for failing to properly
OL,10,Foversee the export of high-spec Nvidia
OL,11,Fchips, as the fallout from the scandal
OL,12,Fwidens.
OL,14,FJensen Huang left Nvidia after
OL,15,Frevelations he had an affair with a
OL,16,Fformer Megaspeed executive who was also
OL,17,Fallegedly a Chinese spy. The firm had
OL,18,Fbeen buying advanced chips from Nvidia.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/17
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
